# 8. WebSocket Message Design

## Start Segmentation

Client → Server

```json
{
  "type": "segment",
  "model": "totalsegmentator",
  "series": "CT001"
}
```

---

## Segmentation Accepted

Server → Client

```json
{
  "type": "segment_started",
  "task_id": "8cfa-123"
}
```

---

## Progress Update

Server → Client

```json
{
  "type": "segment_progress",
  "task_id": "8cfa-123",
  "value": 65
}
```

---

## Segmentation Completed

Server → Client

```json
{
  "type": "segment_complete",
  "task_id": "8cfa-123",
  "volume": "seg001"
}
```

---

## Segmentation Failed

Server → Client

```json
{
  "type": "segment_failed",
  "task_id": "8cfa-123",
  "message": "Segmentation failed."
}
```

